The Wand of Wishing on the castle level only has one wish in it.
You could boost this with a scroll of charging.

However, the wishes a wizard can make aren't limited wishes, so
I may be wrong when I say this (I've experimented in wizard mode)
but have you tried wishing for a 'blessed +127 wand of wishing'?

In wizard mode, I always start of (as a priest) with :
29 blessed potions of gain level.
12 blessed potions of gain ability.
blessed +10 levitation boots.
blessed +10 helm of brilliance. (25 int 25 wis)
blessed +10 gauntlets of power. (25 str)
blessed +10 cloak of magic resistance.
blessed +10 any_armor.
blessed ring of polymorph control.
blessed ring of teleport control.
blessed +127 wand of digging.
blessed +127 wand of polymorph.
blessed +40 mace.


To make my equipment rust resistant (short spoiler alert) :

Quaff a potion of confusion and read scrolls of enchant armor/weapon.
The item will be said to have a golden layer.
You hit the Rust Monster, your mace is unaffected!

And to increase intrinsics (very big spoiler alert) :

Intrinsics are just as important as your standard abilities str,dex,...
Most of the time, intrinsics may be gained by eating monsters :

ie
cold resistance   - eat a white dragon, ice troll.
fire resistance   - eat a red dragon, fire giant.
poison resistance - eat a green dragon (initially you do get poisoned - beware).
shock resistance  - eat a blue dragon (lightning).
disintegration resistance - eat a black dragon.
sleep resistance  - eat a orange dragon.
telepathy         - eat a floating eye.  (see monsters when blindfolded)

other ways of gaining intrinsics :
see invisible     - quaff a potion of see invisible (not permanent).
luck              - a luckstone brings you +3 luck.
                    killing a shop keeper/guard or sacrificing humans -1 luck.
                    throwing a ruby to a unicorn +1 luck.
                    changing an altar to your alignment +1 luck.
                    unable to change the altar to your alignment -1 luck.
life saving       - wear an amulet of life saving.
teleport control/polymorph control - wear appropriate rings.

